    "collapsible_content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Highlights",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>A daily collagen stick built for people who won't stick to a scoop and a shaker. Each stick delivers 5,000mg of hydrolysed marine collagen peptides alongside vitamin C, which contributes to normal collagen formation for the normal function of skin, and biotin, which contributes to the maintenance of normal skin and hair. Unflavoured and fully dissolving, so it disappears into whatever you're already drinking.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to Use",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Stir one stick into at least 200ml of water, coffee, tea or a smoothie once a day. It dissolves clear in hot or cold liquid. Take it consistently — most people notice the difference somewhere between weeks six and twelve. Food supplements should not replace a varied, balanced diet.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's Inside",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>5,000mg Hydrolysed Marine Collagen</strong> — low molecular weight peptides.<br/><strong>Vitamin C</strong> — contributes to normal collagen formation.<br/><strong>Biotin</strong> — contributes to the maintenance of normal skin and hair.<br/><strong>Zinc</strong> — contributes to the maintenance of normal skin and nails.</p><p>No added sugar, no artificial sweeteners, no fillers.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
